# Calibration Records Directory
#
# Per PRD Part 9: Calibration Projects
#
# This directory stores records of calibration project runs.
# Each calibration project creates a subdirectory with:
#
#   calibration/
#     nextjs-hello-YYYYMMDD/
#       config.yaml          # Calibration project config
#       results.json         # Verifier results
#       skills-before.json   # Skill confidence before
#       skills-after.json    # Skill confidence after
#       blockers.md          # Any blockers discovered
#       summary.md           # Human-readable summary
#
# Calibration projects are run:
# - Before trusting agent with real goals
# - After significant environment changes
# - When skill confidence seems uncalibrated
# - Periodically (monthly) to prevent drift
